  {
    "screen": "vault-tool-files-encryption-04",
    "orientation": "h",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "chapter_title",
        "text_ref": "从哪里开始",
        "align": "left",
        "size": "medium"
      },
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text_ref": "已有库要追加，在本机终端运行 vault-tool，选菜单“加密 / 添加文件”，本人在本地输入凭据。AI 技能里的 Encrypt 只会把指定输入新建成一个独立的加密输出（本地确认两次密码、原件保留），没有“追加”模式；AI 可以帮我准备菜单步骤，但不会凭空开一个追加窗口。",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "40%"
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text_card",
        "text_ref": "需要准备什么",
        "row": "start",
        "icon_position": "header_left",
        "header_icon": "_library/hires-icons/icon-clean-0432a3e02a060c22b01c.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "section_heading",
        "text_ref": "从开始到拿到结果",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "60%",
        "heading_icon": "_library/icons/scene-r3-exact-three-stairs.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "numbered_steps",
        "text_ref": "1. **先核对输入和库结构**　工具检查选定原件、目标库格式和追加或替换的影响；旧成员的同名关系要在本地解锁后才能确认。",
        "row": "start",
        "columns": 1,
        "icons": "none",
        "illustration": "none",
        "connector": "none"
      }
    ]
  },
